ottom footer","bbox":[0.17,0.83,0.82,0.87]},"text":"Medical Healthcare Center - 2100 Sherpur Sadar Sherpur, Dhaka Bangladesh hello@healthcare.com / www.healthcare.com","item_id":"C13","kind":"other"}],"promotional_intent":"Persuade prospective patients and community members to utilize the clinic's healthcare services, schedule consultations with specialists, and register for free screenings.","open_observations":["The piece appears to be a graphic design template rather than finalized promotional collateral, as evidenced by placeholder Lorem Ipsum copy, placeholder phone numbers (+000 12345 6489), and placeholder web addresses.","Multiple service entries (Emergency, House Call, Vaccine Test) use duplicate, incomplete sentence fragments ('...so you can have the answers and') copied directly from the banner subhead.","Unsubstantiated superlative claims are made regarding clinic personnel ('world-renowned specialists').","No specific drug product, indication, or prescribing/safety information is present; this material concerns clinical healthcare facility services."],"is_promotional":true}}},"adk_invocation_id":"e-805f3312-e22d-4ba2-949f-07dcefc7e704","adk_author":"sentinel","adk_custom_metadata":{"a2a_metadata":{"thinking":"medium"}},"adk_event_id":"9c295ce0-2a02-437d-9cf8-5756586360c1"},"parts":[],"role":"agent"},"state":"working","timestamp":"2026-10-28T14:12:51.621612Z"},"taskId":"5d3a6b78-fe0d-4b44-b8a9-e74859785e2a"}}
