vices list - Item 3\",\"bbox\":[0.16,0.4,0.83,0.81],\"quote\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text... and, Get an Expert Medical\",\"also_raised_by\":[\"regulatory\"]},{\"id\":\"F-ED-1\",\"lens\":\"editorial\",\"severity\":\"high\",\"confidence\":0.99,\"category\":\"visual_design\",\"observation\":\"A prominent explanatory section contains standard Greeked/Lorem Ipsum placeholder body copy.\",\"principle\":\"Collateral submitted for clinical and operational review must contain finalized copy rather than typesetting placeholders.\",\"items\":[\"C12\"],\"region\":\"Middle right body paragraph\",\"bbox\":[0.56,0.73,0.83,0.81],\"quote\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"also_raised_by\":[]},{\"id\":\"F-MED-2\",\"lens\":\"medical\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"category\":\"clinical_accuracy\",\"observation\":\"The term 'Vaccine Test' is clinically ambiguous and does not reflect recognized medical terminology or standard immunization practices.\",\"principle\":\"Clinical clarity and accuracy of medical service nomenclature\",\"items\":[\"C9\"],\"region\":\"Services list - Item 4\",\"bbox\":[0.16,0.75,0.5,0.81],\"quote\":\"Vaccine Test\",\"also_raised_by\":[\"legal\",\"regulatory\",\"editorial\"]},{\"id\":\"F-MED-3\",\"lens\":\"medical\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"confidence\":0.88,\"category\":\"patient_population\",\"observation\":\"Health screenings are promoted to vulnerable populations (geriatric and pediatric patients under 12) without defining the clinical screening panel, guidelines, or physician follow-up protocols.\",\"principle\":\"Appropriate clinical definition of preventive care for vulnerable populations\",\"items\":[\"C6\"],\"region\":\"Services list - Item 1\",\"bbox\":[0.16,0.56,0.46,0.61],\"quote\":\"Free Health Screening / For senior citizen & children for under 12\",\"also_raised_by\":[]},{\"id\":\"F-MED-4\",\"lens\":\"medical\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"category\":\"clinic